    {
      "id": "5148c047cb56",
      "source": "If you want to render your simulation in a different software you can export it to VDB.",
      "target": "如果想在其他软件中渲染模拟，可以将其导出为 VDB。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9320eea08450",
      "source": "This format can be read by other software like Maya or Blender.",
      "target": "这种格式可以被 Maya 或 Blender 等其他软件读取。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "570d75beec2d",
      "source": "In Embergen VDBs are exported using the ",
      "target": "在 EmberGen 中，VDB 使用 ",
      "note": ""
