      "target": "Volume Processing（体积处理）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dd22697e36a6",
      "source": " node, like sharpening or Post Modulation will be in the VDB file. Other things that are computed in a later stage like shading and lighting are not stored in the VDB file.",
      "target": " 节点中对体积做出的所有更改，例如锐化或 Post Modulation，都会包含在 VDB 文件中。着色和灯光等在后续阶段计算的其他内容不会存储在 VDB 文件中。",
      "note": ""
