      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3beba7600991",
      "source": "In the Controls tab, you can specify the channels you want to be exported. By default, only Density and Flames are checked since these two channels are usually sufficient for rendering the effect.",
      "target": "在 Controls（控制）选项卡中，可以指定要导出的通道。默认情况下只勾选 Density（密度）和 Flames（火焰），因为这两个通道通常足以渲染效果。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "522dcc60d3a7",
      "source": "Coordinate System",
      "target": "Coordinate System",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0b9ce142abb7",
      "source": " is where you specify the coordinate system of the 3d package you are exporting to. For example, when using Blender you should leave this at ",
